<title>BRAZIL: Brazil CTBC Telecom says will invest 156 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Brazil CTBC Telecom says will invest 156 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's private telecom operator CTBC Telecom said it will invest 156 million reais ($149.1 million) this year, nearly 50 percent more than in 1996.</p>
<p>The company said it would increase investments to prepare itself for competition after the privatization of Brazil's telecommunications sector.</p>
<p>CTBC will hold a news conference Wednesday at 1400 local/1600 gmt to disclose details on its investment plan.</p>
<p>((-- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5415))</p>
